{"name":"Baby Steps","hex":"#f5c9da","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"baby steps","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["plural of baby step"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/baby_steps"}],"entries":[{"title":"Baby Steps (manga)","blocks":[{"text":"Baby Steps  is a Japanese manga series by Hikaru Katsuki. It was serialized in Kodansha's shōnen manga magazine Weekly Shōnen Magazine from October 2007 to November 2017, with its chapters collected in 47 tankōbon volumes. The story is centered on Eiichirō Maruo, a first year honor student who one day decides that he is lacking exercise. He then joins the Southern Tennis Club (STC) where he begins his tennis journey."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/dd/Baby_Steps_manga_Japanese_Vol_1_cover.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baby_Steps_(manga)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/dd/Baby_Steps_manga_Japanese_Vol_1_cover.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/dd/Baby_Steps_manga_Japanese_Vol_1_cover.jpeg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABaby_Steps_manga_Japanese_Vol_1_cover.jpeg"}],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Little sparrow on a pink wall","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/ba/Little_sparrow_on_a_pink_wall.jpg/500px-Little_sparrow_on_a_pink_wall.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Little_sparrow_on_a_pink_wall.jpg","share":0.286875},{"title":"Ambigram Bounce, Adidas pink shoe - up and down","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c2/Ambigram_Bounce%2C_Adidas_pink_shoe_-_up_and_down.jpg/500px-Ambigram_Bounce%2C_Adidas_pink_shoe_-_up_and_down.jpg","ratio":0.7148